{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Hecke.HeckeSpanning","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Hecke.HeckeSpanning","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Hecke.HeckeStaircase"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.towerSpan_eq_top","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.towerSpan_eq_top","kind":"theorem","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/HeckeSpanning.lean#L114-L133","doc":"**The tower decomposition is everything.**  `1` is in it and it is closed\nunder right multiplication by generators, and those generate the algebra. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.adjoin_range_σ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.adjoin_range_σ","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/HeckeSpanning.lean#L101-L112","doc":"The generators of `H_m(q)` generate it as a `K`-algebra.  Stated at every\n`m`, not just `n+1`, because the spanning induction needs the `m = 0` base\ncase where the generating set is empty. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.towerSpan_mul_gen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.towerSpan_mul_gen","kind":"theorem","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/HeckeSpanning.lean#L90-L99","doc":"**The tower decomposition is closed under right multiplication by the\ngenerators.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.mul_stair_mul_gen_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.mul_stair_mul_gen_mem","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/HeckeSpanning.lean#L49-L88","doc":"**The four cases, assembled.**  A single summand `a · c_k` times a generator\nstays in the tower decomposition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.one_mem_towerSpan","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.one_mem_towerSpan","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/HeckeSpanning.lean#L45-L47","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.mul_stair_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.mul_stair_mem","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/HeckeSpanning.lean#L40-L43","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.towerSpan","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.towerSpan","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/HeckeSpanning.lean#L34-L38","doc":"The tower decomposition `Σ_{k ≤ n+1} incl(H_n(q)) · c_k`, as a submodule. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.towerSub","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.towerSub","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/HeckeSpanning.lean#L30-L32","doc":"The tower subalgebra: the image of `H_n(q)` inside `H_{n+1}(q)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}